# Secrets and operator-local files never enter the build context
# (security review nit 14): every .env flavour, npm credentials, and the
# gitignored local overrides / live-test scripts, which carry instance
# ids and read real credentials. The Dockerfile copies
# scripts/build-icon.mjs alone, but a context that never holds them
# cannot leak them through a later COPY either.
.env
.env.*
.npmrc
*.local.*
scripts/live-test*
*.log
coverage
